window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The nightmare beneath my bed has only one obsession. Me.</b></p> <p>In a childhood fractured by abuse and neglect, the monster under my bed was my unlikely guardian. <br> The bloody night he abandoned me left me broken, and alone for too many years.</p> <p>But now he’s back.</p> <p>As I’ve matured, so has my need for him. My desires are dark, perverse, and only my monster can satisfy them.</p> <p>At first he refuses to touch me the way I so desperately need. But then his shadows pin me open and tear me apart until I am remade in his darkness.</p> <p>Though my protector has returned, my world is unraveling, ripped apart by the evils of men and the creatures that stalk me from the dark. Violence dogs my every step, until I'm on the verge of becoming something new—something that will make this world tremble.</p> <p>My monster wants to save my humanity. I only crave the corruption of his touch.</p> <p>What we create together is horror, seductive and vile, and I need it to fill every hollow inside me.</p> <p>Even if it kills me.</p> <p><i>Welcome to a new side of Holly Roberds, and a dark monster romance meant for those who like it pitch black</i></p>"; 
